bm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288420/extras/7cff581abeb93e5246f5d17375d8823c.mp4?t=1753780192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Integrated weapons and abilities into your cybernetics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install devastating weapons and cutting-edge abilities directly into your cybernetics. Launch rockets, unleash gouts of flame, or discharge arcs of lightning straight from your palms. Fly with jets built into your legs, blink across the battlefield in a flash, or spot lootable items with enhanced vision. In this world, your body isn\u2019t just augmented - it is a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288420/extras/8c0719b355b59e47d32890dbe84fd0c1.poster.avif?t=1753780192\" width=594 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288420/extras/8c0719b355b59e47d32890dbe84fd0c1.webm?t=1753780192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288420/extras/8c0719b355b59e47d32890dbe84fd0c1.mp4?t=1753780192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendly and hostile factions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character statistics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory and equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vendors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random and tiered loot drops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialog</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the state of the game at any time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied locations to explore</p></li