    "short_description": "Enhanced: Vengeance is a highly difficult, single-player, story-rich, first-person RPG. Upgrade your body with cybernetics as you explore a dangerous new world. Meet intriguing characters, take on quests, level up, blast your way through hostile encounters, and uncover valuable gear.",
